          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அரசியல் — araciyal — \"politics\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "என் தாத்தாவுக்கு அரசியல் பற்றிப் பேசப் பிடிக்கும். eṉ tāttāvukku araciyal paṟṟip pēcap piṭikkum. My grandfather likes to talk about politics."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அரசு, government + -இயல், a field: அரசியல்வாதி, a politician."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "அரசியல் (araciyal) is built from aracu, \"government\", which DEDR 201 traces to Sanskrit rājan, \"king\" (CDIAL 10679), and native iyal, \"nature, field of study\" (DEDR 471)."
            }
          ]
        },
